"""
services/semantic_query_service.py  (v2 - handles ANY wording / typos / joined words)

Runs BEFORE the old regex pipeline in /ask-business.

 history  -> Gemini turns follow-ups into one standalone question (also repairs typos)
 plan     -> Gemini builds a JSON plan from the REAL schema (never computes numbers)
 repair   -> if a column is wrong / execution fails, the error is fed back and it re-plans (max 3 tries)
 execute  -> pandas on the uploaded rows. Column names AND entity values are fuzzy-matched
            ("leathr walet" -> "Leather Wallet", "partynamemonthwise" -> Party Name + month)
 fallback -> if the plan cannot express the question, Gemini writes pandas code which runs
            in a locked-down sandbox (AST-checked, no imports / files / dunder access)
 answer   -> Gemini writes the reply using ONLY the computed numbers

Returns handled=False for raw-row listing / exports / GST report / any failure, so your existing
pipeline still works.  Needs: pip install google-genai pandas numpy ; GOOGLE_API_KEY in env.
"""
import ast
import builtins
